msgid "MakeFlyEasy Striver Mini Hand Throw"
msgstr "MakeFlyEasy Striver Mini 手抛固定翼"

#: ../../source/docs/common-makeflyeasy-striver-mini-hand-throw.rst:11
#: 4da08d57164d4a05a4bd40bb6c3ee816
msgid ""
"This is a new generation of aerial test hand-thrown fixed wing, which "
"inherits the safe and practical qualities of the MakeFlyEasy Fighter. The "
"MFE team has made every effort to further improve the flight stability, "
"power configuration and quick disassembly of this vehicle."
msgstr ""
"这是新一代手抛固定翼航测无人机，继承了 MakeFlyEasy Fighter 安全实用的品质。MFE "
"团队进一步提升了该飞行器的飞行稳定性、动力配置和快拆性能。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-makeflyeasy-striver-mini-hand-throw.rst:13
#: 3a11d37922674cd5a538901402eec5da
